      "Pre-adoption typed repository diagnosis; unconditional selected packaged libgit2 helper independently of command master/mask.",
      "Separate folder access and explicit exact-root safe.directory permission; no automatic exception, wildcard trust or original-operation retry.",
      "Captured lexical configuration candidates permit sandbox authorization before filesystem target selection.",
      "Authoritative global/HOME/XDG/GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL selection, captured canonical file and root/symlink witnesses, exact confirmation and neutral-context --file append.",
